	(text "RC filter for ACK line in target mode.\nStandard allows 25 pF per device.\n74LVT245 input capacitance is 4 pF plus 12 pF  extra = 16 pF total.\nGives 1.8 ns rise time / 90 MHz cutoff.\nIn initiator mode the RC filter is bypassed."
